OL,3,GNEWSAThe landlocked rowers making waves
OL,4,Aat sea
OL,5,
OL,6,FRowers from a landlocked club say it
OL,7,Fwill be "amazing" to take part in the
OL,8,Fworld championships for sea-going
OL,9,FCornish pilot gig boats.
OL,11,FMidland Cornish rowing club is based at
OL,12,FStaunton Harold reservoir in Derbyshire
OL,13,F- which is only 10 miles from the point
OL,14,Fin Great Britain furthest from the sea
OL,15,F- but competes against crews from
OL,16,Fplaces with long traditions of coastal
OL,17,Frowing.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
