OL,3,GNEWSAThe landlocked rowers making waves
OL,4,Aat sea
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe team row Cornish pilot gig boats,
OL,7,Fwhich are six-oared fixed-seat vessels,
OL,8,Fmeasuring 32ft (9.7m) and based on a
OL,9,Fdesign for a working craft dating back
OL,10,Fto the late 18th Century.
OL,12,FMidland Cornish will be heading off to
OL,13,Fthe world championshops in the Isles of
OL,14,FScilly, from 30 April to 2 May, which
OL,15,Fattract about 2,000 rowers.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
